{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/5853b7a03ff08693f3b589bb9aaf4676.poster.avif?t=1770840544\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/5853b7a03ff08693f3b589bb9aaf4676.webm?t=1770840544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/5853b7a03ff08693f3b589bb9aaf4676.mp4?t=1770840544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Within</strong> is a first-person psychological horror where fear is born within the protagonist\u2019s mind. A house, familiar from childhood and youth, gradually loses its logic: light behaves strangely, objects come to life, and the past seeps into the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on atmosphere, psychological tension, and storytelling through the environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore locations, interact with objects, and solve atmospheric puzzles. Every action reveals fragments of the story, while the world changes depending on the protagonist\u2019s perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players piece together events themselves, observing details and interpreting occurrences to gradually understand the character\u2019s inner world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/53d4a65f49efb74af0ab29147989c3e7.poster.avif?t=1770840544\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/53d4a65f49efb74af0ab29147989c3e7.webm?t=1770840544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/53d4a65f49efb74af0ab29147989c3e7.mp4?t=1770840544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror with a focus on story and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamically changing locations and environmental elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist gameplay without combat or weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storytelling through environment, light, and sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings depending on your actions and perception of the world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/6f01af8b999c5f0d2fe35329b4713694.poster.avif?t=1770840544\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/6f01af8b999c5f0d2fe35329b4713694.webm?t=1770840544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/6f01af8b999c5f0d2fe35329b4713694.mp4?t=1770840544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man whose world is shattered by loss: first he loses his daughter, then his wife. Every room holds memories, regrets, and images he cannot forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During exploration, you find notes and fragments of memory, encounter ghostly voices and objects from the past that intertwine with the present. The truth gradually emerges, and the player pieces together the story of the protagonist and his family, realizing that the boundary between reality and the inner world is nearly erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/acd4d05a8f991e576c7a1f2e71f908cb.poster.avif?t=1770840544\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/acd4d05a8f991e576c7a1f2e71f908cb.webm?t=1770840544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/acd4d05a8f991e576c7a1f2e71f908cb.mp4?t=1770840544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3061950?t=1770840544","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/ef0e364002c0494d2adf78df87f7ca58df96dfed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770840544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/b5b0e5be572b3fe7d72cbeede8b6917c5e0bca49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770840544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/b5b0e5be572b3fe7d72cbeede8b6917c5e0bca49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770840544","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This video game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, and may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised."},"controller_support":"full","demos":